{"name":"Seabrook","hex":"#4b81af","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Seabrook","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A placename:\nA suburban coastal village in Hythe parish, Folkestone and Hythe district, Kent, England .\nA number of places in the United States:\nAn unincorporated community in Liberty County, Georgia.\nA census-designated place in Prince George's County, Maryland.\nA census-designated place in Barnstable County, Massachusetts.\nA town in Rockingham County, New Hampshire. \nAn unincorporated community in Cumberland County, New Jersey.\nAn unincorporated community in Beaufort County, South Carolina.\nA city in Harris County, Texas.\nAn unincorporated community in Grays Harbor County, Washington.\nA suburb of Melbourne in the City of Hobsons Bay, Victoria, Australia","A suburban coastal village in Hythe parish, Folkestone and Hythe district, Kent, England ."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Seabrook"}],"entries":[{"title":"Seabrook, Victoria","blocks":[{"text":"Seabrook is a suburb in Melbourne, Victoria, Australia, 19 km (12 mi) south-west of Melbourne's Central Business District, located within the City of Hobsons Bay local government area. Seabrook recorded a population of 4,952 at the 2021 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Seabrook-park.jpg/330px-Seabrook-park.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seabrook%2C_Victoria"},{"title":"Wynyard, Tasmania","blocks":[{"text":"Wynyard (/ˈwɪnjərd/) wi-nyuhd) is a rural town located on the North West coast of Tasmania, Australia. Wynyard is situated 17 kilometres (11 mi) west of Burnie. As of the 2021 census, Wynyard has an estimated population of 6,296. The town is a regional hub servicing the surrounding rural areas. The main council offices for the Waratah-Wynyard local government area are located in Wynyard."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Table_Cape_by_dusk.JPG/330px-Table_Cape_by_dusk.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wynyard%2C_Tasmania"},{"title":"Seabrook (surname)","blocks":[{"text":"Seabrook is a locational surname from Seabrook, Buckinghamshire."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seabrook_(surname)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Seabrook-boulevard.jpg/120px-Seabrook-boulevard.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Seabrook-boulevard.jpg/250px-Seabrook-boulevard.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Seabrook-boulevard.jpg/120px-Seabrook-boulevard.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASeabrook-boulevard.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg/120px-Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg/250px-Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg/120px-Seabrook-homesteadrun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASeabrook-homesteadrun.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Seabrook-servicestation.jpg/120px-Seabrook-servicestation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Seabrook-servicestation.jpg